      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry for your loss. It's completely understandable why you'd feel this way. It's possible that there are still lingering digital reminders or habits set up in the smart devices by your partner, which might be why you're noticing those specific behaviors. These instances are generally just a result of embedded settings and data, rather than any attachment to you. Would you like help in exploring and tweaking your smart home setup to better suit your needs?",
